{
  "Combat.Aiko.ArcaneArcher.One": "\"I'll show you my training as a guardian... can you stand my magic and my bow? Let's find out,\" she says."
  "Combat.Aiko.ArcaneArcher.Two": "You see her body enveloped by a golden aura, and sparks of yellow-white arc out from her from time to time, she looks a little frightening!"
  "Combat.Aiko.ArrowBarrage.Text": "Aiko lets loose a barrage of arrows and they strike you with the speed of a machine gun!"
  "Combat.Aiko.ArrowRain.Text": "Aiko nocks a series of arrows made of pure light and shoots them into the air! The hailstorm of bolts comes crashing down, impaling you {0} times!"
  "Combat.Aiko.Basic.Double": "Aiko nocks an arrow and lets it fly, swiftly following it with another!"
  "Combat.Aiko.Basic.Glance": "You shrink away from the impending impact, but it strikes at an angle, glancing off your armor and tumbling into the woods."
  "Combat.Aiko.Basic.Hit": "Aiko nocks an arrow and lets it fly with deadly precision! It protrudes from your body painfully, making it somewhat difficult to move around."
  "Combat.Aiko.Basic.Miss": "Aiko nocks an arrow and lets it fly, and it disappears into the woods."
  "Combat.Aiko.CorruptBasic.Avoided": "You manage to avoid the arrow."
  "Combat.Aiko.CorruptBasic.Text": "Aiko looses an arrow at you with a snarl."
  "Combat.Aiko.DarkFoxfire.Text": "Aiko conjures a dark flame and hurls it at you, the black fire clinging to your skin and seeping into your body."
  "Combat.Aiko.HyperAttack1": "You notice Aiko is not attacking and seems to be preparing for something big! She bows her head over her bow, muttering an incantation."
  "Combat.Aiko.HyperAttack2.One": "Aiko gathers an enormous amount of energy and draws her bow to its absolute limit."
  "Combat.Aiko.HyperAttack2.Survive": "You barely manage to survive the blast, and find Aiko standing gaping at you."
  "Combat.Aiko.HyperAttack2.Two": "\"I'll punish every demon in this world!\" She releases an immense beam of golden white light directly at you!"
  "Combat.Aiko.IceArrow.Hit": "You are hit by one of the frozen arrows, frost rapidly spreading over the skin surrounding the arrow."
  "Combat.Aiko.IceArrow.Miss": "You narrowly avoid the barrage of frozen arrows."
  "Combat.Aiko.IceArrow.One": "Aiko rapidly shoots a flurry of arrows made of pure ice, leaving a big trail of frost behind them!"
  "Combat.Aiko.LightArrowCage.Corrupt": "Due to your high corruption, the light sears your skin and burns incredibly."
  "Combat.Aiko.LightArrowCage.One": "Aiko groans with effort and summons an incredible amount of arrows made of pure light! They all strike at once, converging on you at the center!"
  "Combat.Aiko.SplinterLightning.One": "Aiko summons her magic inside her bow and shoots a lightning arrow that splits into a multitude of dangerous sparks!"
  "Combat.Aiko.SplinterLightning.Two": "You fall to the ground, your legs giving in once the initial shock lets up."
  "Combat.Aiko.Tease.Four": "Aiko gives you a come-hither smile, one hand drifting down her stomach."
  "Combat.Aiko.Tease.One": "Aiko sashays closer, running her hands along her body and giving you a flirtatious leer."
  "Combat.Aiko.Tease.Three": "Aiko runs a hand along her tails and fans them out around her seductively."
  "Combat.Aiko.Tease.Two": "Aiko takes a moment to stretch out her limber body, thrusting out her chest as she stretches."
  "Combat.Aiko.Terrorize.NoResist": "You have nothing to steel your mind against the illusion."
  "Combat.Aiko.Terrorize.Resisted": "You steel yourself against the illusion and it fades away."
  "Combat.Aiko.Terrorize.Text": "Aiko whispers an incantation and your surroundings twist into a waking nightmare!"
  "Combat.Aiko.Tomahawk.Hit": "The tomahawk strikes you with brutal force!"
  "Combat.Aiko.Tomahawk.Miss": "The tomahawk whistles past your head and buries itself in a tree."
}
